{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24945","headline":"金在熔 · 白行简","name":"金在熔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巨橐方熔物，洪鑪欲范金。\n紫光看渐发，赤气望逾深。\n焰热晴云变，烟浮昼景阴。\n坚刚由我性，鼓铸任君心。\n踊跃徒标异，沈潜自可钦。\n何当得成器，待叩向知音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白行简","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24945.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24945","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}